{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0662_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0662_1000_029umi", "source_sha256": "ae1c5102e76aedfdd36e7e80bd556d953b699ad05bb994cbe035694e5730b32f", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！　おはよーっ！\n今日も一日よろしくね！　にぱーっ♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！早上好——！\n今天也请多关照啦！笑一个～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0662_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0662_1001_p", "source_sha256": "53221b4df8399dd2d2f3774b4d0de8a96e6f7848288392c54896f8b07b8ae136", "ja": "あ、ああ。おはよう……？", "zh": "啊，嗯。早上好……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0662_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0662_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "59ca162c3357c322e545e1e7084d4484a5eb855bd286caf5ff0a64286908e0f2", "ja": "あれ！？　なんか思ってた反応と違う……。\nうーん、この笑顔は違うってことか……。", "zh": "咦！？感觉这反应和我想的不太一样……\n唔～看来这种笑容不太对吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0662_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0662_1003_p", "source_sha256": "1322a5051b5f4b6193bd0bf88ba8d0721a71c231bbbe95f40d61a42043009c9b", "ja": "何を悩んでるか知らないが……\n海美らしくて、すごくいい挨拶だったよ。", "zh": "虽然不知道你在烦恼什么……不过很有海美的风格，是非常棒的问候哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0662_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0662_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "9de512ee9945adb7d36488d35b0fa61c7c6a8704f36161155d8a7b28fedb1b58", "ja": "それじゃダメなの！　女子力アップのヒケツは『小悪魔\nスマイル』だって聞いたから、挑戦したんだけど……。", "zh": "那样可不行！我听说提升女性魅力的秘诀是“小恶魔微笑”，所以才试着挑战了一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0662_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0662_1005_p", "source_sha256": "23161abd668b976eab589f9657fd067eda20a340456799a5166656f5d56c33c3", "ja": "……いつもの笑顔だったな。", "zh": "……还是平时那种笑容啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0662_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0662_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "5bab017ee5e29d5e4babe196fa80c6f06bd60087e443676b4b496dd80a815638", "ja": "私、笑顔はすっごく得意なのに……。\nどうやったら小悪魔っぽい笑顔ができるのかなー？", "zh": "我笑起来明明超厉害的……。\n怎样才能笑出小恶魔那种感觉呢——？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0662_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0662_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6b40c4dcddfeecce5351dbf7f412e61236bbf26f57f2e96f091f981637c24e49", "ja": "そうだなぁ。あまり深く考えないのがコツかもな。\n海美は、自然体が一番魅力的だ！", "zh": "是啊……关键可能是别想得太复杂。\n海美最自然的样子才是最有魅力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0662_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0662_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "426f12537694139246554cbe3ff4ee630ca29b389ffc67c412fb122a3b28c026", "ja": "ホントッ！　私、そのままでも小悪魔っぽい！？\n女子力高めってことだよね！　えへへ……♪", "zh": "真的！我就算保持原样，也有点像小恶魔吗！？\n也就是说，我很有女人味吧！嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0662_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0662_1009_p", "source_sha256": "34d0feda0ab49c4bcc366acf72664cdde5026651d2f3e0f3cbe525096fdee899", "ja": "（一瞬ドキッとしてしまった……。自然体が一番と\n言ったが……海美は天然の小悪魔かもしれないな）", "zh": "（刚才有一瞬间心里一惊……我虽然说过最重要的是自然状态……\n但海美或许是天生的小恶魔也说不定。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
